OL,3,GNEWSAUS military aircraft leave second
OL,4,AUK base, report says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MoD spokesperson told the BBC: "We
OL,7,Fdo not routinely comment on the
OL,8,Factivity of other nations. Aircraft and
OL,9,Fother assets move regularly
OL,10,Fb@Kaccording to operational
OL,11,Fb@Krequirements."
